F1A: Nominal facility price, average total percent change from 2000 baseline,
by procedure group. F1B: Inflation-adjusted facility price, same. F1.pdf
combines both as a two-panel figure with A/B labels (F1.png is the same
figure at 600 dpi). Generated by F1.ipynb,
which also writes ../../Supplementary_Tables/ST2/ST2.csv.
